{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-plays-in-the-sand-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "ef29f10dd697f53460c5a8401515822f2a309bdab9816c87326721ab018634c3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a325fc2ec0fc5246e84b9c27e4dc55a1795f8c442f5737ef58f6a4fcde7c49b",
      "text": "Wukong Plays\nin the Sand",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d305879c574db381c82d55b3dc6058c5eb34e6552ab181801ec20aa0386be86b",
      "text": "Wukong had a big plan.\n“A mountain of sand!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2ac2d791e755d49fc5e18d5eee9b6ada1e543a80b852c104ee40f01c0de78b2",
      "text": "He filled his little bucket.\nDry sand.\nTip! The sand fell flat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c031495b22a06b846b96d876d79795b048aba898ffab0e4480aca59071885ab6",
      "text": "“A hat!” said Pigsy.\n“Try it on?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd27978e437fafb9d6c6fe3ebc4170a0b42b609fb5128fae5cd0ab90e1d2c8bf",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought some water.\n“Let’s try wet sand.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26c4a3756e49aad1c01c5bc1775799bf59b808be320cc27063e6706afcf16a17",
      "text": "Glug, glug, glug.\n“Oops! Sand soup!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a495893342f1778bb550730eab667feb96fbfc053b3b5b08ad092b9414559d4",
      "text": "Wukong put his bucket down.\n“Mountains are hard to make.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "14410ef1a06a85246c050d21c3fd2bccec7e180b47e6e6208648c814dbb2aee1",
      "text": "“One small try?” said Sandy.\nWukong nodded.\n“Dry sand. A little water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b86527db65176bf9174404992b78c0bf3a58895a6dd2c1be5cac808e7f7c5dfd",
      "text": "They mixed the wet sand.\nThey pressed it.\nIt stuck together.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5702f42c3c8d06d5ec6ba650118a247842a9498faa29a24c11b848eb479138a7",
      "text": "Scoop, scoop.\nPat, pat, pat.\n“Ready?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "829f2a4f1c06923e4ff333058299c3476961bcbdd8d2747b86761a54102d779d",
      "text": "They tipped the bucket.\nThey lifted it slowly.\nA tower stood tall!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d663acb93dd4e4dabc9c4bdfec6c2edf44b1115867658c0bd9afd5b7ae8db099",
      "text": "Wukong made a tiny mountain.\nPigsy made a round cake.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30255fd7c8c60a7cf2ff952da0df1523b509b0eee88bbf7f72ec4c26bcd674ab",
      "text": "Ao Bing dug a little pool.\nHe poured in water.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb0b6457ca18b150bd2615c054ce601a48496b902283fd62da750c682fb65e1a",
      "text": "“Who lives in this tower?”\nasked Pigsy.\n“A tiny king!” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b8432e9599f9ccf5a37b9bfa2d43bff3e7511b65aafc60dc088e30fe0460c7e",
      "text": "They packed the toys away.\nSandy helped brush off sand.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0d5a23dbed9144077993c05c5ccf17e2b388776953b2979003961d0a6137a8f2",
      "text": "Wukong tipped out his shoe.\n“Look! A mountain came too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a545cb385ff2736a96bcf41b2c72b43669ca35b648ed8b0d9425c42479df3fda",
